From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johan Althoff <teetow@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:14:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(rcontrol): let the app start the server when it is ready

The server started during module init, before the app could handle
commands. RControlModule(autoStart = false) now leaves it closed, and the
app opens it through the new IRemoteControl interface once it is ready,
so a client that connects knows the app is up. Starting reports failure
(for example a port already in use). The default stays autoStart = true.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 framework/rcontrol/CMakeLists.txt        |  1 +
 framework/rcontrol/iremotecontrol.h      | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 framework/rcontrol/mcp/mcpcontroller.cpp | 16 +++++++---
 framework/rcontrol/mcp/mcpcontroller.h   |  8 +++--
 framework/rcontrol/mcp/mcpserver.cpp     |  6 ++--
 framework/rcontrol/mcp/mcpserver.h       |  2 +-
 framework/rcontrol/rcontrolmodule.cpp    | 10 +++++--
 framework/rcontrol/rcontrolmodule.h      | 12 ++++++--
 8 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 framework/rcontrol/iremotecontrol.h

diff --git a/framework/rcontrol/CMakeLists.txt b/framework/rcontrol/CMakeLists.txt
index 2f399691a..0a4e6bd4a 100644
--- a/framework/rcontrol/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/framework/rcontrol/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ target_link_libraries(muse_rcontrol PRIVATE Qt::Network)
 target_sources(muse_rcontrol PRIVATE
     rcontrolmodule.cpp
